{
  "slug": "ronclad",
  "name": "Ronclad",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A disciplined, token-efficient agentic skills framework — 20 skills enforcing structured workflows: brainstorm before you build, test before you ship, recover before you spiral. Built-in error recovery, context management, token budgeting, and adaptive review.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **20 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (20): `activate` (Run at the start of every session — performs a capability self-assessment, maps available skills to the task…), `adversarial-review` (Use when code is ready for review — the agent plays devil's advocate and actively tries to break…), `assumption-audit` (Use before any implementation begins — surfaces, rates, and validates every assumption the agent is making), `branch-strategy` (Use before starting any non-trivial implementation — defines full branch strategy including risk assessment, merge windows, feature flag…), `cognitive-offload` (Use when working on large projects, multi-session work, or when context is becoming full — maintains a structured…), `completion-protocol` (Use when a development branch is ready to close — produces a structured handoff artifact including diff summary,…), `confidence-based-tdd` (Use during all implementation work — extends RED-GREEN-REFACTOR with confidence scoring, behavioral correctness checks, and chaos scenarios), `cost-envelope` (Use when starting any project or when costs are a concern — models total execution cost across multiple…), and 12 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ronclad@claude-community` from `tsilly07/ironclad-v3`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
